<p align="center">
  <strong><mark>The Web Sever</mark></strong>
</p>
 this code using **Flask** for **API and interface**. Also saving private information/result and push those into web server by **Socket.IO** in realtime. Generally, it manages patient records, receiver measurement requests from the web interface, and provides the **ESP32** with measurement commands. When blood pressure date arrives. It also streams live pressure readings to display 
